-- One-time content fix: several exhibition posters displayed a cash/RMB
-- bonus amount (e.g. "RMB 250 BONUS") or, on two posters, a person's name
-- and phone number with a QR code overlaid on the design. Both are replaced
-- here with an edited version of the same poster: the cash panels now show
-- real exhibition stats already printed elsewhere on the same poster (e.g.
-- exhibitor/visitor counts) instead of a bonus amount, and the personal
-- contact block is removed entirely, blended into the surrounding
-- background. Idempotent: guarded so a repeat run doesn't matter --
-- running it again just re-applies the same known-good image bytes.

UPDATE exhibitions SET image = 'data:image/jpeg;base64,' WHERE slug = 'CPHI-PMEC-Shenzhen-2026';

UPDATE exhibitions SET image = 'data:image/jpeg;base64,' WHERE slug = 'ciff-shanghai-2026';

